OL,3,AWebsites taken down worldwide as
OL,4,Acritical cyber-security update issued
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe flaws were discovered by AI, with
OL,7,Fcyber-security firm Wiz saying they
OL,8,Fwere the "most severe vulnerabilities
OL,9,Fever discovered" by the tech, which is
OL,10,Freshaping the cyber landscape.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/19
