OL,3,AWhy is Elon Musk plotting a mega-merger
OL,4,Aof SpaceX and Tesla?
OL,5,
OL,6,FElon Musk has spent years building
OL,7,FTesla and SpaceX into a pair of
OL,8,Ftrillion-dollar technology empires.
OL,9,FNow, he is considering bringing them
OL,10,Ftogether.
OL,12,FAsked on Tuesday whether a merger would
OL,13,Fbe a good idea, Musk was clear: "Yes."
OL,15,FThe prospect is more than hypothetical.
OL,16,FMusk said special committees have been
OL,17,Fformed to assess a potential deal,
OL,18,Falthough he stressed that there is no
OL,19,Fguarantee a merger will happen and that
OL,20,Fnothing has been agreed.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
